      "message": "yes.  In that case we should not have TC_FLAGS_AUTO_TOGGLE_REQUESTED set and drp_state[port] will not be PD_DRP_TOGGLE_ON, so we will go direct to LOW_POWER mode.  This entire piece of code is to catch PD_DRP_TOGGLE_ON with no TC_FLAGS_AUTO_TOGGLE_REQUESTED. Every thing else will run direct into LOW_POWER",
